<title>UK: Abidjan dockers mount strike - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Abidjan dockers mount strike - Lloyds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dockers at Abidjan in Ivory Coast began an indefinite strike on Monday, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It had no further details.</p>
</text>
